.TH XIL\-EPISODE\-SUMMARY "1" "2026\-07\-29" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-episode\-summary
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-episode\-summary
[-h] [--output FILE] [--show NAME] [--stdout]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a one\-row\-per\-episode summary CSV from all parsed_<tag>.json files.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fI\,FILE\/\fR
Output CSV path (default: <workspace>/episode_summary.csv)

.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,NAME\/\fR
Filter to a single show name, e.g. 'THE 413' (case\-insensitive)

.TP
\fB\-\-stdout\fR
Write CSV to stdout — no banner, safe to pipe

